l-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,-2940)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(2281,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(6440,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Iodine </text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(14710,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Purple </text></g></g></g><line data-line=\"v\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"5305\" y1=\"-3385\" x2=\"5305\" y2=\"3885\"></line><line data-line=\"v\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"12375\" y1=\"-3385\" x2=\"12375\" y2=\"3885\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"2455\" x2=\"21880\" y2=\"2455\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"985\" x2=\"21880\" y2=\"985\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-485\" x2=\"21880\" y2=\"-485\"></line><line data-line=\"h\" class=\"mjx-solid\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-1955\" x2=\"21880\" y2=\"-1955\"></line><rect data-frame=\"true\" class=\"mjx-solid\" width=\"21810\" height=\"7200\" x=\"35\" y=\"-3350\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><br><br>\n(i) The molecular orbital energy level diagram explains the appearance of colour by halogens. The MOT for halogens is represented.<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lhzx8yy3/50e7bf16-6311-4c62-9df5-9f197a5c667f/c0dc0bb0-f936-11ed-ad2d-b539535f47fe/file-1lhzx8yy4.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lhzx8yy3/50e7bf16-6311-4c62-9df5-9f197a5c667f/c